        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="t8_xbar" parent="1" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#dae8fc;strokeColor=#6c8ebf;fontSize=13;fontStyle=1;verticalAlign=middle;align=center;spacingLeft=20;spacingRight=20" value="System bus: AXI crossbar (axi_xbar)&#xa;Replaces soc_axi_arbiter + soc_axi_demux. Per-target arbitration; multiple outstanding requests can be in flight to different targets concurrently.&#xa;In the end state the xbar exposes only ~2 slave targets: the peripheral subsystem (one APB bus) and an optional RAM-fallback path (mostly used by debug SBA)." vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="140" width="1700" x="155" y="300" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
