        <mxCell id="t8_arb_note" parent="t8_memss" style="text;html=1;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;whiteSpace=wrap;fontSize=11;fontStyle=2" value="per-bank round-robin arbiters (soc_mem_ss internal; NumInitPorts is also a parameter)" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="40" width="1540" x="30" y="160" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="t8_bank0" parent="t8_memss" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#e1d5e7;strokeColor=#9673a6;fontSize=13;fontStyle=1;verticalAlign=middle" value="bank[0]" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="280" width="240" x="30" y="220" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="t8_bank1" parent="t8_memss" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#e1d5e7;strokeColor=#9673a6;fontSize=13;fontStyle=1;verticalAlign=middle" value="bank[1]" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="280" width="240" x="290" y="220" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="t8_bank2" parent="t8_memss" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#e1d5e7;strokeColor=#9673a6;fontSize=13;fontStyle=1;verticalAlign=middle" value="bank[2]" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="280" width="240" x="550" y="220" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="t8_bank3" parent="t8_memss" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#e1d5e7;strokeColor=#9673a6;fontSize=13;fontStyle=1;verticalAlign=middle" value="bank[3]" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="280" width="240" x="810" y="220" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="t8_bank_ellipsis" parent="t8_memss" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#9673a6;fontSize=11;verticalAlign=middle;align=center;dashed=1" value="...&#xa;(MemNumBanks is&#xa;a parameter,&#xa;default 4)" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="280" width="220" x="1070" y="220" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="t8_three_tier_note" parent="1" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#666666;fontSize=11;align=left;spacingLeft=12;spacingTop=8;spacingRight=12;spacingBottom=8" value="Why this layered shape?&#xa;&#xa;Memory subsystem (soc_mem_ss): per-bank arbitration. Memory-heavy initiators (CPU instr/data, DMA, accelerators) get dedicated init ports so bank parallelism actually pays off - the bus fabric does not gate memory bandwidth.&#xa;&#xa;System bus (axi_xbar): per-target AXI arbitration. In the end state the xbar exposes only ~2 slave targets: the peripheral subsystem and an optional RAM-fallback path. The xbar is small because most traffic does not need it.&#xa;&#xa;Peripheral subsystem (APB bus): a single APB peripheral bus behind one soc_axi_to_apb bridge. UART, CLINT (wrapped), DM regs (wrapped), accelerator CSR windows, and future SPI/I2C/GPIO/timers all fan out from one APB demux. Adding a new peripheral is &quot;add to the APB subsystem&quot;, not &quot;reconfigure the xbar&quot;.&#xa;&#xa;What grows linearly: arbiters. M arbiters in the xbar for M targets (only a handful in the end state); B arbiters in soc_mem_ss for B banks; the APB subsystem needs no arbitration (peripherals are slaves, they do not initiate). Wires fan out N x B inside soc_mem_ss but synthesis handles that cleanly at this scale." vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="310" width="610" x="1715" y="580" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
